{
  "_doc": [
    "Maps a topic's scope terms onto a resume skill, so TopicTagger can decide new|refresh|exp.",
    "`names` are matched against the confirmed profile's skill names (case-insensitive substring),",
    "`terms` against the topic's title + scope.",
    "",
    "`terms` lists the ESTABLISHED surface of a skill — the parts a practitioner with the claimed",
    "years has necessarily touched. It deliberately omits recent additions (virtual threads/Loom,",
    "records, sealed classes, GraalVM native image): claiming 'Java, expert, 11 yrs' says nothing",
    "about having used a 2023 API, so those topics stay `new` rather than being downgraded to a",
    "refresh of claimed expertise. Add a term here only when the skill claim genuinely implies it."
  ],
